{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rail Fights</i> is a fast-paced, one-screen arcade shooter built around tight movement, timing, and constant pressure. Players move their tanks along a closed oval rail, bump opponents, capture powerful launchers, and line up shots to total enemies across the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914600/extras/644513c6427b791c916df0d41abbc08e.poster.avif?t=1771525308\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914600/extras/644513c6427b791c916df0d41abbc08e.webm?t=1771525308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914600/extras/644513c6427b791c916df0d41abbc08e.mp4?t=1771525308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Couch Party</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed-time matches for up to 8 local players, playable in Solo, Duo, or Quad team formats. Fight together and against each other, destroy opposing tanks, and outscore your opponents before time runs out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless, arcade-style score-driven race against time versus 7 bots. Bots start heavily handicapped but grow stronger as you score. Destroy tanks to earn extra seconds and push your score up the leaderboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a partner in an endless co-op survival challenge against 6 escalating bots. Coordinate your movement and shots, earn extra time by destroying opposing tanks and climb the leaderboard together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914600/extras/38f335dc347ca8003833b700f87f2b9a.poster.avif?t=1771525308\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914600/extras/38f335dc347ca8003833b700f87f2b9a.webm?t=1771525308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914600/extras/38f335dc347ca8003833b700f87f2b9a.mp4?t=1771525308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Play, Hard to Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are simple and immediately approachable, allowing anyone to jump in and play. Mastery comes from learning the arena\u2019s shape and missile speeds, managing momentum, predicting opponent movement, and timing shots under pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture Your Launcher</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your tank\u2019s firepower by capturing launcher tokens that appear in the arena. Cannons, rockets, lasers and grenade launchers all behave differently with their unique firing speeds, cooldowns and destructive power that demand adopting different strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bumper Compression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold your ground when pushed by enemies to compress your tank\u2019s bumpers and kick nearby opponents away. Kicked tanks stall briefly, creating openings to reposition or line up decisive shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914600/extras/80d732ed093ee36a40670217343d5f8f.poster.avif?t=1771525308\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914600/extras/80d732ed093ee36a40670217343d5f8f.webm?t=1771525308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914600/extras/80d732ed093ee36a40670217343d5f8f.mp4?t=1771525308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced one-screen arcade combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer for up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch Party mode with Solo, Duo, and Quad team formats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival and Co-Survival modes with endless score challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards for high survival scores</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Top of the World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1914600/d96ae7bc8c33cb16a150156b9a9353f58e5daf75.jpg"},{"name":"BORING!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1914600/d0306b07c5600b43369401fd1b82eac667360d9f.jpg"},{"name":"Survivalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1914600/5e020a8c4583c9e4ad0ebb91b8de80c723c92117.jpg"},{"name":"First Century","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1914600/d7c79599502cf0a9865a8a4154d69704fb6431c1.jpg"},{"name":"Half Century","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1914600/fcd5cd79bb9237b6aea5f7367bac8e3842f5a39a.jpg"},{"name":"Warmed Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1914600/41362186683578b906b6916ddd1589a344aa6cbb.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1914600/152ef7ffc6fcd1680c89d969ab5642079f438b65.jpg"},{"name":"Untouchable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1914600/eb0a70c95f93958f91164c617c41601eed40806b.jpg"},{"name":"Efficient Totaler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/191