 endless score challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards for high survival scores</p></li></ul>","developers":["Korner Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914600/1fc2c00d816c91883033a0155a4c563af5f006c8/header.jpg?t=1771525308","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS (64-bit) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.5 GHz x64-compatible CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics (Intel HD Graphics or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 (Catalina)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics (Intel or Apple)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1914600/245365774/9c949692552227f82a846dabdbda09e573b9cdb5/1769702290/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769703373","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1914600/245365774/9c949692552227f82a846dabdbda09e573b9cdb5/1769702290/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769703373","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers